# core/data/talk/grammar/en/open_greet.tlk - greetings: by time of day, first meeting and old friends,
# by mood, voice and persona type (owner: TK; T5b package T5B-OPEN). Clean in any room: no register
# word, no romance (a greeting never flirts), kid voices are kid banks. Rule names start with o_.
# Syntax: core/tools/talkc_gen.py.

# ---- time of day ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.greet.o_morning guard: time=morning act: greet
  "Good morning, {you}! The fog is only mildly judgemental today."
  "Morning! I've had one coffee and a small argument with the toaster."
  "Oh, you're up! Early birds get the worm. I'd rather have toast."
  "Rise and shine, {you}! Or just rise. Shining is optional."
@rule core.greet.o_morning_b guard: time=morning act: joke
  "It's too early for words. Here's a wave. {.}And some words."
@rule core.greet.o_morning_c guard: time=morning act: ask_feeling
  "Morning! Did you sleep well, or did the walls hum again?"
@rule core.greet.o_day guard: time=day act: greet
  "Afternoon, {you}! Perfect timing. I was just getting bored."
  "Hello there! Lovely day. Well, a day, I've seen worse."
  "Hi, {you}! You've caught me mid-nap. I mean mid-thought."
  "Good day! Come in, mind the cursed rug, it's in a mood."
@rule core.greet.o_day_b guard: time=day act: tell
  "Hi! I've been sorting socks all day. There's a lot of socks."
@rule core.greet.o_day_c guard: time=day act: ask_feeling
  "Hey, {you}! How's your day going? Good, bad, or soup?"
@rule core.greet.o_evening guard: time=evening act: greet
  "Good evening, {you}! Dinner's almost ready. Allegedly."
  "Hello! The sun's going down, nothing to fear. Mostly."
  "Evening! Come in, the lamps are lit and the bats are loud."
  "Oh, hello, {you}. Just in time for the good chairs."
@rule core.greet.o_evening_b guard: time=evening act: joke
  "Hello! You smell like supper. Is that supper, please?"
@rule core.greet.o_evening_c guard: time=evening act: ask_feeling
  "Evening! How was your day? Tell me the good bits first."
@rule core.greet.o_night guard: time=night act: greet
  "Oh! A night visitor! Come in, I'm up anyway."
  "Hello, {you}. It's late. The good kind of late."
  "Shh, hi. Everything's asleep except us and the owls."
  "Night owl, huh? Pull up a chair, there's tea and moonlight."
@rule core.greet.o_night_b guard: time=night act: joke
  "Hello! Is it the middle of the night? That's my favourite middle."
@rule core.greet.o_night_c guard: time=night act: ask_feeling
  "Hello! Can't sleep? Me neither, what's keeping you up?"

# ---- first meeting and old friends ---------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.greet.o_first guard: first act: greet
  "Hello! I don't think we've met. I'd remember, I'd write it down."
  "Hi there! New face! Don't worry, everyone here is weird."
  "Oh, hello! Welcome. The tour is short and mostly lies."
  "Well hello, new person. I'm friendly. The rug isn't."
@rule core.greet.o_first_b guard: first act: ask_feeling
  "Hello! You look new. How are you finding the place so far?"
@rule core.greet.o_first_c guard: first act: joke
  "Hi! Don't tell anyone, but I'm nervous around new people. Hi."
@rule core.greet.o_friend guard: rel=friend act: greet
  "Hey, you! I was hoping you'd drop by. Good timing."
  "There you are! I saved you a seat. And a rumour."
  "Hi, friend! Come in, no need to knock. Well, knock politely."
  "Oh, it's you! My day just got ten percent better."
@rule core.greet.o_friend_b guard: rel=friend act: tell
  "Oh, good, you're here! You'll never guess what happened. Sit."
@rule core.greet.o_friend_c guard: rel=friend act: ask_feeling
  "Hey, you! How've you been? The real answer, not the polite one."
@rule core.greet.o_best guard: rel=best act: greet
  "{you}! There you are! I was about to send a search party."
  "Oh, thank goodness. Finally, a good person in my house."
  "Hi, my favourite! You can have the comfy chair. I mean it."
@rule core.greet.o_best_b guard: rel=best act: joke
  "Is that you? I was about to tell the cat all my secrets."
@rule core.greet.o_family guard: rel=family act: greet
  "Hello, {you}! Home again. We kept your chair and your socks."
  "Oh, hi! Did you eat? Wash up, then tell me everything."
@rule core.greet.o_acq guard: rel=acquaintance act: greet
  "Oh, hello again! Nice to see a familiar face. Or most of one."
  "Hi, {you}! We should talk more. We've talked twice, it was nice."
@rule core.greet.o_stranger guard: rel=stranger act: greet
  "Hello. I know your face but not your name. Remind me?"
@rule core.greet.o_rival guard: rel=rival act: complain
  "Oh, joy. You. The day was going so smoothly."
  "You again. I'd say it's a pleasure, but I'm not a liar. Often."
@rule core.greet.o_rival_b guard: rel=rival act: tease
  "Oh, hello! I'd say I missed you, but my day was lovely."

# ---- moods ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.greet.o_happy guard: mood=happy act: greet
  "[HAPPY]Hi, {you}! Great day! Everything's great, hi!"
  "[HAPPY]Oh, you're here! I'm so happy I could burst. Gently."
@rule core.greet.o_sad guard: mood=sad act: greet
  "[SAD]Oh, hi, {you}. I'm glad you're here. I'm a bit down."
  "[SAD]Hello. Sorry, I'm not much company today. Sit anyway?"
@rule core.greet.o_angry guard: mood=angry act: greet
  "[ANGRY]Hi. Not your fault. Something's got me annoyed."
  "[ANGRY]Hello. I'm not mad at you, I'm mad at a spoon. Long story."
@rule core.greet.o_scared guard: mood=scared act: greet
  "[SHOCK]Oh! Phew, it's you. I thought you were the noise."
  "[SHOCK]Hello! Sorry, I'm jumpy. Something creaked twice."
@rule core.greet.o_tired guard: mood=tired act: greet
  "[SLEEPY]Hi, {you}. Sorry, I'm a bit zzz. Say something loud."
  "[SLEEPY]Oh... hello. I'm awake, in a small, quiet way."
@rule core.greet.o_weird guard: mood=weird act: greet
  "Hello! Does the air feel sparkly to you? Just me, then."
  "Hi, {you}! I've had the strangest feeling all morning. It's you."

# ---- voices: by manner ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.greet.o_polite guard: polite act: greet
  "How do you do, {you}? Do come in. Mind the step."
  "Good day! What a delightful surprise. May I take your coat?"
@rule core.greet.o_blunt guard: blunt act: greet
  "Oh. Hi. Come in or don't, the draught's coming in either way."
  "Hey. What do you want? Kidding, hi."
@rule core.greet.o_flat guard: flat act: greet
  "Hello. {.}This is me being thrilled."
  "Hi. I'm waving. Inside."
@rule core.greet.o_loud guard: loud act: greet
  "HELLO! COME IN! I'M HERE AND YOU'RE HERE, GREAT!"
  "HEY HEY HEY! LOOK WHO IT IS! IT'S YOU!"
@rule core.greet.o_elder guard: elder act: greet
  "Well, hello, dear. Come in, mind my knees. They bite."
  "Oh, there you are. Come, sit, I've got so many stories."
@rule core.greet.o_quirky guard: quirky act: greet
  "Hello! Do you hear that humming? It's just my hat."
  "Oh! Hi! I was talking to the lamp, it's a great listener."
@rule core.greet.o_easy guard: easygoing act: greet
  "Hey, {you}. No rush. Pull up a chair, a cushion or the floor."
@rule core.greet.o_serious guard: serious act: greet
  "Good day, {you}. I trust you are well. Please state your business."

# ---- the kid voices ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.greet.o_kid guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: greet
  "Hi! I found a rock. It's my best friend now, want to see?"
  "Hello! Guess what? I lost a tooth!"
  "Hi, hi, hi! You're just in time. I'm making a fort."
@rule core.greet.o_kid_b guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: ask_feeling
  "Hi! Are you good? I had two snacks, are you hungry?"
@rule core.greet.o_kid_c guard: kid_speaker tags: kid act: joke
  "Hi! Knock knock, oh, you're already in. Okay."
@rule core.greet.o_teen guard: teen act: greet
  "Hey. Hi. I'm super busy doing nothing."
  "Hey. What's up? Don't say the ceiling, it's been done."

# ---- the persona types ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@rule core.greet.o_t_bookworm guard: type=quiet_bookworm act: greet
  "Oh! Hello. Sorry, I was on chapter nine, a long chapter."
@rule core.greet.o_t_napper guard: type=cozy_napper act: greet
  "Mm? Oh, hi. Is it time, is there a blanket?"
@rule core.greet.o_t_gremlin guard: type=grumpy_gremlin act: greet
  "What? Oh, it's you. Fine, don't touch my stuff."
@rule core.greet.o_t_drifter guard: type=deadpan_drifter act: greet
  "Hello. Wow. A person, thrilling."
@rule core.greet.o_t_dreamer guard: type=gentle_dreamer act: greet
  "Oh, hello... I was drifting on a cloud. It was soft."
@rule core.greet.o_t_sunbeam guard: type=sweet_sunbeam act: greet
  "[HAPPY]Hi, hi! Aww, it's you! You're my favourite visitor!"
@rule core.greet.o_t_poet guard: type=dramatic_poet act: greet
  "Behold! A visitor arrives, as dusk upon the weary hill!"
@rule core.greet.o_t_charmer guard: type=cheeky_charmer act: greet
  "Well, well, well. Look who's got the best timing. Me, obviously."
@rule core.greet.o_t_helper guard: type=diligent_helper act: greet
  "Hello! Can I take your coat, your bag or your worries?"
@rule core.greet.o_t_adventurer guard: type=chill_adventurer act: greet
  "Hey, {you}! Up for a stroll later? Or a mild expedition?"
@rule core.greet.o_t_captain guard: type=stern_captain act: greet
  "Attention! {you} reports. Good, be seated at ease."
@rule core.greet.o_t_wild guard: type=wild_card act: greet
  "Hi! Or hello. Or boop, I can't decide."
@rule core.greet.o_t_goget guard: type=eager_go_getter act: greet
  "Hi, {you}! Perfect, let's start. What are we starting, anything?"
@rule core.greet.o_t_bubbly guard: type=bubbly_sparkler act: greet
  "[HAPPY]Ooh, hi, {you}! Look at you, so sparkly! I'm sparkly too!"
@rule core.greet.o_t_leader guard: type=fiery_leader act: greet
  "Hello, {you}! Right on time. Come on, we've got work to do."
@rule core.greet.o_t_chaos guard: type=chaos_goblin act: greet
  "Hi! Don't look under the couch. It's a normal couch."
